# Vendored libraries, kept exactly as published so 3rdparty/checksums.txt and
# the integrity hashes in index.html stay meaningful. Reformatting one would
# fail tests/3rdparty.test.js, which is the point. Listed by extension rather
# than as 3rdparty/, because ignoring the directory would also ignore
# 3rdparty/README.md, which is ours, and a later "!3rdparty/README.md" cannot
# bring it back: nothing under an ignored directory can be re-included.
3rdparty/**/*.js
3rdparty/**/*.css

# The data. Prettier has no CSV formatter, and these are edited in spreadsheets.
dataFiles/

# Transcribed minutes and research notes, kept as they were written. Reflowing
# them would put this repository's line-length preferences into someone else's
# words. notes/README.md is ours, so it is formatted.
notes/corrections-2015-12.md
notes/minutes/
notes/research/

